  "title": "New Mexico Lottery Results and Winning Numbers",
  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1174\" class=\"elementor elementor-1174\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-36a79719 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"70764\" data-id=\"36a79719\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-434856e9\" data-eae-slider=\"39732\" data-id=\"434856e9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25e5f807 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"25e5f807\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><br></h2><h2>New Mexico Lottery Games</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-OpeningHours\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-OpeningHours tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Prize Type</th><th class=\"column-3\">Numbers</th><th class=\"column-4\">Sale Closes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">3 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">1:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">3 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">4 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">1:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">4 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Roadrunner Cash</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-37</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-69 + 1 from 1-26</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-70 + 1 from 1-25</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:45 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lotto America</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-52 + 1 from 1-10</td><td class=\"column-4\">8:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- #tablepress-OpeningHours from cache -->\n<h2><br></h2><h2>Game Schedule</h2>\n<p><br></p><div id=\"tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule-scroll-wrapper\" class=\"tablepress-scroll-wrapper\">\n\n<table id=\"tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-ImportIODrawScheudule tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Sunday</th><th class=\"column-3\">Monday</th><th class=\"column-4\">Tuesday</th><th class=\"column-5\">Wednesday</th><th class=\"column-6\">Thursday</th><th class=\"column-7\">Friday</th><th class=\"column-8\">Saturday</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">1:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">1:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">1:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Roadrunner Cash</td><td class=\"column-2\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">9:30 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\">8:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\">8:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\"></td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\">9:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lotto America</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\">9:15 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\">9:15 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div><!-- #tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule from cache -->\n<p><br></p><p>*All times are displayed in New Mexico local time.</p>\n<h2><br></h2><h2>Advance Draws</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>The number of consecutive draws each New Mexico State Lottery games allows you to play:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-AdvancedDraws\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-AdvancedDraws tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Advanced Draws</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Day</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Roadrunner Cash</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lotto America</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 20</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- #tablepress-AdvancedDraws from cache -->\n<h2><br></h2><h2>Tax Information</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>New Mexico Lottery Federal, and state tax withholdings on winnings for U.S. citizens or residents.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-USResidentsTax\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-USResidentsTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">6.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">24.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- #tablepress-USResidentsTax from cache -->\n<p><br></p><p>If the winner is not a U.S. citizen or is not a US resident, New Mexico Lottery tax withholdings on winnings are as such:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-NonUSTax\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-NonUSTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">6.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">30.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- #tablepress-NonUSTax from cache -->\n<figure><br></figure><figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"382\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/New-Mexico.jpg\" alt=\"New Mexico lottery\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/New-Mexico.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/New-Mexico-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/New-Mexico-768x367.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"><p></p>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2><br></h2><h2>About the New Mexico Lottery</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>The New Mexico State Lottery was created one year before Jeff Bezos became a millionaire. Jeff was born in New Mexico, and if you want to know what it is like to make what Jeff makes in a day or a week, playing the New Mexico Lottery is the way to go.</p><p><br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Playing the lottery in New Mexico also means contributing to education in that state, including bursaries for school leavers. The most popular games are Mega Millions and Powerball. Other games like Lotto America, Roadrunner Cash, Lucky Numbers Bingo, Pick 3, Pick 4, and scratch&nbsp;</p><p>games are also pretty popular.</p>\n<h2><br></h2><h2>New Mexico Lottery FAQ</h2><div><br></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f0c5d29 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"67296\" data-id=\"f0c5d29\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e42c8d2\" data-eae-slider=\"38344\" data-id=\"e42c8d2\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8083ae9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"8083ae9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-8083ae9\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"8083ae9\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-new-mexico\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1341\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Requirements to Buy Lottery Tickets in New Mexico?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1341\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-new-mexico\"><p>Players 18 and older and present in New Mexico can buy a ticket or New Mexico lottery scratch card at a participating retailer. Online sales are not possible. There is a handy New Mexico Lottery app that acts as a New Mexico lottery ticket scanner and provides information on New Mexico lottery codes.</p><p> </p><p>A My Rewards account lets you scan non-winning tickets, check New Mexico lottery results, and keep track of draws.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-new-mexico\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1342\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Lottery Games Can You Play in New Mexico?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1342\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-new-mexico\"><p>Lottery in New Mexico offers seven different games. Interestingly, there is no New Mexico lottery Lucky for Life game on offer. The popular statewide games of Powerball and Mega Millions are available, as well as some other notable titles:</p><p> </p><p>Lotto America – Choose five numbers from 1-52</p><p>Roadrunner Cash – Choose five numbers from 1-37</p><p>Lucky Numbers Bingo – Choose from ten lucky numbers to match bingo patterns</p><p>Pick 4 – Choose four numbers from 0-9</p><p>Pick 3 – Choose three numbers from 0-9</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"where-and-how-do-i-claim-winnings-from-the-new-mexico-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1343\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Where and How Do I Claim Winnings from the New Mexico Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1343\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"where-and-how-do-i-claim-winnings-from-the-new-mexico-lottery\"><p>When a player checks the New Mexico lottery results and finds a prize up to $600 was won, that prize may be claimed from a participating retailer or through the mail.  Prizes over $600 must be claimed at Lottery Headquarters, or through the mail using a claim form.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-you-play-and-win-in-the-new-mexico-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1344\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How Do You Play and Win in the New Mexico Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1344\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-you-play-and-win-in-the-new-mexico-lottery\"><p>The New Mexico Lottery numbers need to match your selection. For instance, Lotto America requires a player to pick five numbers between 1-52. The objective is to predict which five numbers will appear in the draw. Smaller cash prizes can also be won with as little as two New Mexico Lottery winning numbers.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-new-mexico-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1345\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Odds of Winning the New Mexico Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1345\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-new-mexico-lottery\"><p>The odds of winning the New Mexico lottery Mega Millions jackpot are 1 in 302 million. For the New Mexico Lottery Powerball, it is 1 in 175 million. Other odds are as follows:</p><p> </p><p>Lotto America – 1 in 26 million</p><p>Roadrunner Cash – 1 in 435,897</p><p>Lucky Numbers Bingo – 1 in 3.35</p><p>Pick 4 – 10 000</p><p>Pick 3 – 1 in 1000</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"whats-the-biggest-new-mexico-lottery-win\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1346\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What’s the Biggest New Mexico Lottery Win?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1346\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"whats-the-biggest-new-mexico-lottery-win\"><p>The luckiest ticket bought in New Mexico was a Powerball ticket that won $206.9 million in 2008. The winner(s) chose to stay anonymous.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-new-mexico-lottery-results-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1347\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the New Mexico Lottery Results Draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1347\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-new-mexico-lottery-results-draw\"><p>The results of the New Mexico lottery become available as follows:</p><p> </p><p>Lotto America: Wednesdays and Saturdays at 9:15 pm</p><p>Roadrunner Cash: Daily at 9:30 pm</p><p>Lucky Numbers Bingo: Daily every four minutes</p><p>Pick 4 and Pick 3: 1:30 pm and 9:30 pm</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-is-the-new-mexico-lottery-second-chance\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1348\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Is the New Mexico Lottery Second Chance?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1348\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"what-is-the-new-mexico-lottery-second-chance\"><p>If your New Mexico lottery scratch card didn’t win or missed out on the New Mexico lottery winning numbers, New Mexico Lottery Second Chance may come to the rescue. Non-winning scratchers, Roadrunner Cash, and Pick 3 tickets can be scanned using the New Mexico lottery app or website. Each month, $5 000 cash and 300 win points are awarded.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-new-mexico-lottery-winnings\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1349\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Do I Have to Pay Tax on New Mexico Lottery Winnings?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1349\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-labelledby=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-new-mexico-lottery-winnings\"><p>New Mexico lottery winners pay a state tax of 6%. On top of that, federal taxes are payable. These have a top tier of 37%.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1952dfd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"10538\" data-id=\"1952dfd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0f06bac\" data-eae-slider=\"38627\" data-id=\"0f06bac\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c646a35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c646a35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the New Mexico Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2c516c7\" data-eae-slider=\"32154\" data-id=\"2c516c7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11b62be elementor-button-success elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"11b62be\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-lg\" href=\"/Contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Send Us an Email</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-61422b5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"74070\" data-id=\"61422b5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-65daa1e\" data-eae-slider=\"97622\" data-id=\"65daa1e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5ab2a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"e5ab2a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Are the Requirements to Buy Lottery Tickets in New Mexico?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Players 18 and older and present in New Mexico can buy a ticket or New Mexico lottery scratch card at a participating retailer. Online sales are not possible. There is a handy New Mexico Lottery app that acts as a New Mexico lottery ticket scanner and provides information on New Mexico lottery codes.\\n\\n \\n\\nA My Rewards account lets you scan non-winning tickets, check New Mexico lottery results, and keep track of draws.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Lottery Games Can You Play in New Mexico?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Lottery in New Mexico offers seven different games. Interestingly, there is no New Mexico lottery Lucky for Life game on offer. The popular statewide games of Powerball and Mega Millions are available, as well as some other notable titles:\\n\\n \\n\\nLotto America \\u2013 Choose five numbers from 1-52\\n\\nRoadrunner Cash \\u2013 Choose five numbers from 1-37\\n\\nLucky Numbers Bingo \\u2013 Choose from ten lucky numbers to match bingo patterns\\n\\nPick 4 \\u2013 Choose four numbers from 0-9\\n\\nPick 3 \\u2013 Choose three numbers from 0-9\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Where and How Do I Claim Winnings from the New Mexico Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"When a player checks the New Mexico lottery results and finds a prize up to $600 was won, that prize may be claimed from a participating retailer or through the mail.  Prizes over $600 must be claimed at Lottery Headquarters, or through the mail using a claim form.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How Do You Play and Win in the New Mexico Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The New Mexico Lottery numbers need to match your selection. For instance, Lotto America requires a player to pick five numbers between 1-52. The objective is to predict which five numbers will appear in the draw. Smaller cash prizes can also be won with as little as two New Mexico Lottery winning numbers.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Are the Odds of Winning the New Mexico Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The odds of winning the New Mexico lottery Mega Millions jackpot are 1 in 302 million. For the New Mexico Lottery Powerball, it is 1 in 175 million. Other odds are as follows:\\n\\n \\n\\nLotto America \\u2013 1 in 26 million\\n\\nRoadrunner Cash \\u2013 1 in 435,897\\n\\nLucky Numbers Bingo \\u2013 1 in 3.35\\n\\nPick 4 \\u2013 10 000\\n\\nPick 3 \\u2013 1 in 1000\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What\\u2019s the Biggest New Mexico Lottery Win?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The luckiest ticket bought in New Mexico was a Powerball ticket that won $206.9 million in 2008. The winner(s) chose to stay anonymous.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When Is the New Mexico Lottery Results Draw?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The results of the New Mexico lottery become available as follows:\\n\\n \\n\\nLotto America: Wednesdays and Saturdays at 9:15 pm\\n\\nRoadrunner Cash: Daily at 9:30 pm\\n\\nLucky Numbers Bingo: Daily every four minutes\\n\\nPick 4 and Pick 3: 1:30 pm and 9:30 pm\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Is the New Mexico Lottery Second Chance?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"If your New Mexico lottery scratch card didn\\u2019t win or missed out on the New Mexico lottery winning numbers, New Mexico Lottery Second Chance may come to the rescue. Non-winning scratchers, Roadrunner Cash, and Pick 3 tickets can be scanned using the New Mexico lottery app or website. Each month, $5 000 cash and 300 win points are awarded.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do I Have to Pay Tax on New Mexico Lottery Winnings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"New Mexico lottery winners pay a state tax of 6%. On top of that, federal taxes are payable. These have a top tier of 37%.\"}}]}</script>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
